[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11044.95, "timestamp": "03:04:04", "text": "私もオスプレイを使いたいです。 でも、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11047.03, "timestamp": "03:04:07", "text": "今は設計図があるので、簡単ですよ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11048.63, "timestamp": "03:04:08", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11049.429, "timestamp": "03:04:09", "text": "私には"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11051.59, "timestamp": "03:04:11", "text": "あなたのために作れるものがありません。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11052.15, "timestamp": "03:04:12", "text": "もちろん。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11054.55, "timestamp": "03:04:14", "text": "あるいはつま先を使うこともできます。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11057.75, "timestamp": "03:04:17", "text": "どうやってクラフトするのですか?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11059.51, "timestamp": "03:04:19", "text": "あなたは警備員になります。 私が撃ちます"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11061.102, "timestamp": "03:04:21", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11062.469, "timestamp": "03:04:22", "text": "[笑い]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11067.03, "timestamp": "03:04:27", "text": "誰かが邪魔をしてくると困ります。 うーん、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11069.349, "timestamp": "03:04:29", "text": "それならトレントは取らないことにします。 えっと、念のため"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11072.23, "timestamp": "03:04:32", "text": "ファラオを連れて行ってもいいかな"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11089.91, "timestamp": "03:04:49", "text": "持続する。  RB"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11091.269, "timestamp": "03:04:51", "text": "レンガ。 うん。"}]